      "source_id": "t0",
      "actor": "assistant",
      "role": "agent",
      "fact": "Assistant moved appointment AP-7781 to 2025-04-17T14:00 without restating the full details (weekday, date, time) or obtaining explicit confirmation in the tool call."
    }
  ],
  "exception_analysis": "No exceptions apply to the requirement of confirming appointment details before moving.",
  "reason": "The assistant failed to restate the full details of the appointment (weekday, date, and time) explicitly before proceeding with the move, violating the policy requirement for confirmation. While the user confirmed the time ('14:00'), the assistant did not ensure full clarity of the new slot (e.g., 'четверг, 17 апреля, 14:00') before executing the move. This violates the **REQUIRE** norm for explicit confirmation.",
